<title>USA: IPO PRICE-Hartford Life prices at $28.25/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICE-Hartford Life prices at $28.25/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		  Hartford Life Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At				    $28.25</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $24 - $27</p>
<p>   Number of Shares	    18.4 million U.S.</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	    Goldman Sachs Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The total number of shares offered is 23 million, with 18.4 million offered in the U.S. and 4.6 million internationally. As a unit of Hartford Financial Services Group Inc, the company will still own 100 percent of Hartford Life's Class B stock, which translates into a stake of about 81.4 percent, assuming the underwriters' overallotment options were exercised in full.</p>
</text>
